{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりのぶろぐに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってしまいました。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ライブもありとドタバタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してて...寂しくさせてしまったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさいーー。うぅ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしようかな。まず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのことを書くべき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのか選抜発表について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書くべきか...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2つを同じ記事で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きたくないんだよな੯ू❛ัू ໒꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーーー。きっとふぁみたんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表のことのが聞きたいと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思うのでこっちから書こうかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー結果として7thめの選抜には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入ることは出来ませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でも絶対残れるとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう自信もなかったですし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーになるのかな？とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってたりもしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でたくさんの方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じてるからと言われた時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直その時にはもう結果は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かっていたのでどんな顔を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"していいか分かりませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも信じてもらえる程"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしはふぁみたんに信用"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"されているんだなと考えると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいものもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信持ってよー！っとよく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われますがそんな自信って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に持てるものではないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えているものがあれば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突き進んでいったら結果も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てくるし自信にも繋がります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDを出すごとに色んなメンバーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェンジされその時によって雰囲気も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がらっと変わり色んな乃木坂カラー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がある。だから選抜に入れ替えが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるのはもっと乃木坂の良さを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だしていくためでもあると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのために今回のセンターは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀ちゃんが選ばれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀ちゃんもきっと自信は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないだろうし不安でしか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしは自信なんてなくたって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと他の16人のメンバーも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれるだろうしまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な作品が出来上がると思います。"},{"ty